  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Damage to or credible threats against export infrastructure in the Russia–Ukraine theatre forces buyers and sellers to reroute volumes toward Gulf suppliers and longer sea legs that transit Hormuz/Bab al‑Mandeb, increasing throughput through those chokepoints.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
