  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Larger and faster defense budget commitments finance additional naval/air assets, contractors and sustainment that enable more or longer deployments to protect energy transit corridors in the Strait of Hormuz and the Red Sea.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">hormuz_redsea_tensions</data>
</edge>
