  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.95</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher global crude prices raise refinery feedstock costs and margins, which are passed through into higher wholesale and retail fuel prices within weeks to months.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
