  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A marked rise in global oil prices feeds into higher inflation and monetary tightening globally, raising borrowing costs and thereby tightening the availability and terms of capital for Indo‑Pacific infrastructure projects.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">hormuz_redsea_tensions</data>
  <data key="d39">indo_pacific_rivalry</data>
