  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A sharp deterioration in bond-market liquidity tightens trade-finance and working-capital availability for oil traders and tanker owners, causing postponed liftings, fewer voyages and slower settlements that reduce throughput through key chokepoints.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
