  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained net outflows from global bond investors withdraw deployable capital and push investors to reduce exposure to longer‑horizon, illiquid infrastructure and strategic projects, directly reducing cross‑border strategic investment volumes into the Indo‑Pacific.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
