  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased bank funding stress forces banks to restrict lending and delay payments to defense contractors and Treasury intermediaries, directly slowing procurement and the execution of pledged defense spending for the Ukraine war effort.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_bond_rout</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
