  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A surge in geopolitically-directed capital into Indo‑Pacific strategic assets reallocates portfolio allocations away from sovereign bonds (to project equity, private credit or local currency assets), producing net bond outflows from affected markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
