  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A rise in targeted investment and trade flows from Indo‑Pacific actors (e.g., Chinese firms, state banks) into Russia creates alternative markets, finance and procurement channels that blunt the scope and enforcement efficacy of Western sanctions on Moscow.</data>
